543
00:42:57,475 --> 00:43:01,275
私から離れる心も見えないわ
I can't even see my heart drifting away from me.

544
00:43:01,275 --> 00:43:04,675
そう知らない
That's right, I don't know.

545
00:43:04,675 --> 00:43:07,875
自分から動くこともなく
Without even moving on my own,

546
00:43:07,875 --> 00:43:11,675
時の隙間に流され続けて
I continue to be swept away in the gaps of time.

547
00:43:11,675 --> 00:43:15,075
知らないわ 周りのことなど
I don't know anything about my surroundings,

548
00:43:15,075 --> 00:43:18,275
私は私 それだけ
I am just myself, and that's all.

549
00:43:18,275 --> 00:43:21,875
夢見てる なにを見てない
Am I dreaming? I see nothing,

550
00:43:21,875 --> 00:43:25,275
語るも無駄な 自分の言葉
my own words are pointless to speak.

551
00:43:25,275 --> 00:43:28,875
悲しむなんて 疲れだけよ
Feeling sad only wears me out,

552
00:43:28,875 --> 00:43:32,275
何も感じず 過ごせばいいの
it's best to live feeling nothing at all.

553
00:43:32,275 --> 00:43:35,675
戸惑う言葉 与えられても
Even if I am given bewildering words,

554
00:43:35,675 --> 00:43:39,075
自分の心 ただ上の空
my heart is just somewhere else.

555
00:43:39,075 --> 00:43:42,275
もし私から 動くのならば
If I were to make a move myself,

556
00:43:42,275 --> 00:43:46,075
すべて変えるのなら 黒にする
and if I were to change everything, I'd make it black.

557
00:43:46,075 --> 00:43:49,275
こんな自分に 未来はあるの？
Is there a future for someone like me?

558
00:43:49,275 --> 00:43:52,875
こんな世界に 私はいるの？
Am I really in a world like this?

559
00:43:52,875 --> 00:43:56,275
今切ないの？ 今悲しいの？
Am I in pain now? Am I sad now?

560
00:43:56,275 --> 00:43:59,675
自分のことも 分からないまま
Without even understanding myself.

561
00:43:59,675 --> 00:44:02,875
歩むことさえ 疲れだけよ
Even just walking only wears me out,

562
00:44:02,875 --> 00:44:06,275
人のことなど 知りもしないわ
and I don't know a thing about anyone else.

563
00:44:06,275 --> 00:44:09,875
こんな私に 変われるのなら
If even someone like me could change,

564
00:44:09,875 --> 00:44:13,275
もし変われるのなら 白になる
if I could change, I would turn to white.

565
00:44:27,875 --> 00:44:31,475
流れてく時の中ででも
Even within the flowing passage of time,

566
00:44:31,475 --> 00:44:35,075
気だるさがほら グルグル回って
look, listlessness keeps spinning round and round.

567
00:45:02,835 --> 00:45:05,835
悲しむなんて 疲れるだけよ
Grieving is just tiring...

568
00:45:05,835 --> 00:45:09,135
何も感じず 過ごせばいいの
It's fine to just get by without feeling anything.

569
00:45:09,135 --> 00:45:12,535
戸惑う言葉 与えられても
Even if confusing words are given to me,

570
00:45:12,535 --> 00:45:16,035
自分の心 ただ上の空
My own heart is just in the clouds.

571
00:45:16,035 --> 00:45:19,235
もし私から 動くのならば
If I were to make a move myself,

572
00:45:19,235 --> 00:45:22,235
すべて変えるのなら 黒にする
If I'm to change everything, I'd turn it to black.

573
00:45:23,035 --> 00:45:26,335
動くのならば 動くのならば
If I were to move, if I were to move...

574
00:45:26,335 --> 00:45:29,835
すべて壊すわ すべて壊すわ
I'll destroy everything, I'll destroy everything!

575
00:45:29,935 --> 00:45:33,135
悲しむならば 悲しむならば
If I were to grieve, if I were to grieve...

576
00:45:33,135 --> 00:45:36,635
私の心 白く変われる?
Could my heart change to white?

577
00:45:36,735 --> 00:45:40,135
貴方のことも 私のことも
Whether it's about you, or about me,

578
00:45:40,135 --> 00:45:43,635
全てのことも まだ知らないの
Or about everything, I still don't know.

579
00:45:43,635 --> 00:45:47,035
重い目蓋を 開けたのならば
If I were to open my heavy eyelids...

580
00:45:47,035 --> 00:45:50,835
すべて壊すのなら 黒になれ
If I'm to destroy everything, let it turn black!

581
00:46:46,335 --> 00:46:51,235
いつか君が瞳に灯す愛の光が
One day, the light of love you light in your eyes

582
00:46:51,235 --> 00:46:54,335
時を超えて
will transcend time...

583
00:46:54,335 --> 00:46:59,335
滅び急ぐ世界の夢を 確かに一つ
And surely destroy one of the dreams of a world

584
00:46:59,335 --> 00:47:01,835
壊すだろう
that is rushing toward its demise.

585
00:47:01,835 --> 00:47:04,835
躊躇いを飲み干して
Swallow down your hesitation.

586
00:47:04,835 --> 00:47:08,335
君が望むものは何?
What is it that you desire?

587
00:47:08,335 --> 00:47:12,335
こんな欲深い憧れの行方に
On the path of such a greedy yearning,

588
00:47:12,335 --> 00:47:18,335
儚い明日はあるの?
is there a fleeting tomorrow?

589
00:47:18,335 --> 00:47:22,835
子供の頃 夢に見てた
Like the ancient magic

590
00:47:22,835 --> 00:47:26,835
古の魔法のように
I used to dream about as a child,

591
00:47:26,835 --> 00:47:30,335
闇さえ砕く力で
with a power that can even shatter darkness,

592
00:47:30,335 --> 00:47:34,335
微笑む君に会いたい
I want to meet you smiling.

593
00:47:34,335 --> 00:47:38,335
怯えるこの手の中には
Within these trembling hands

594
00:47:38,335 --> 00:47:41,835
手折られた花の勇気
is the courage of a plucked flower.

595
00:47:41,835 --> 00:47:45,835
想いだけが頼る全て
Our feelings are all we can rely on

596
00:47:45,835 --> 00:47:49,835
光を呼び覚ます
to awaken the light...

597
00:47:49,835 --> 00:47:53,835
願い
Our wish.

598
00:47:59,335 --> 00:48:03,335
いつか君も誰かの為に
One day, you too will surely desire

599
00:48:03,335 --> 00:48:07,335
強い力を望むのだろう
a great power for the sake of someone else.

600
00:48:07,335 --> 00:48:10,835
愛が胸を捉えた夜に
On the night love captured your heart,

601
00:48:10,835 --> 00:48:14,835
未知の言葉が生まれて来る
unfamiliar words will be born.

602
00:48:14,835 --> 00:48:17,835
迷わずずにいけるなら
If I can go on without hesitation,

603
00:48:17,835 --> 00:48:22,035
心が砕けてもいいわ
I wouldn't mind even if my heart shatters.

604
00:48:22,035 --> 00:48:25,835
いつも目の前の哀しみに
I want a spell

605
00:48:25,835 --> 00:48:30,835
立ち向かう為の呪文が欲しい
to confront the sorrow always in front of me.

606
00:48:31,835 --> 00:48:35,835
君はまだ夢見る記憶
You are still a memory in a dream,

607
00:48:35,835 --> 00:48:39,835
私は眠らない明日
while I am a sleepless tomorrow.

608
00:48:39,835 --> 00:48:43,835
二人が出会う奇跡を
To seize the miracle

609
00:48:43,835 --> 00:48:47,635
勝ち取る為に進むわ
of our meeting, I will march forward.

610
00:48:47,635 --> 00:48:51,335
怯えるこの手の中には
Within these trembling hands

611
00:48:51,335 --> 00:48:54,835
手折られた花の刃
is the blade of a plucked flower.

612
00:48:54,835 --> 00:48:58,835
想いだけが生きる全て保存
Our feelings are all we have to live for,

613
00:48:58,835 --> 00:49:02,835
心に振りかざす
brandishing them in our hearts...

614
00:49:02,835 --> 00:49:09,835
願い
Our wish.

615
00:50:04,380 --> 00:50:10,780
囚われた太陽の輝く
The captured sun shines...

616
00:50:12,080 --> 00:50:18,780
不思議の国の本が好きだった頃
Back when I loved books about Wonderland,

617
00:50:19,680 --> 00:50:23,280
願いはきっと叶うと
believing that wishes

618
00:50:23,280 --> 00:50:27,780
教えるおとぎ話を信じた
would surely come true, as fairy tales taught,

619
00:50:27,980 --> 00:50:34,780
光と影の中
within the light and shadow...

620
00:50:42,480 --> 00:50:50,280
静かに咲き乱れていた古の魔法を優しく
The ancient magic that quietly bloomed in full glory gently

621
00:50:50,380 --> 00:50:57,780
世界を変える力がその手にあると囁く
whispers that the power to change the world is in your hands.

622
00:50:57,880 --> 00:51:01,580
終わらない夢を見よう
Let us dream an endless dream

623
00:51:01,680 --> 00:51:05,380
君と行く時のなかで
within the flow of time spent with you,

624
00:51:05,480 --> 00:51:09,580
想いだけが生きるすべて
where our feelings alone are everything to live for

625
00:51:09,680 --> 00:51:13,780
命を作るのは願い
and wishes are what create life.

626
00:51:44,480 --> 00:51:49,480
わー！
Yay!

627
00:51:49,780 --> 00:51:54,280
アキちゃん！お誕生日おめでとう！
Aki-chan, happy birthday!

628
00:51:54,380 --> 00:51:58,280
ありがとう！イェーイ！
Thank you! Yay!

629
00:51:58,480 --> 00:52:01,380
今日は来てくれて本当にありがとうございます。
Thank you so much for coming today.

630
00:52:01,480 --> 00:52:06,280
こちらこそですよ！呼んでくれてありがとう！
The pleasure is ours! Thank you for inviting us!

631
00:52:06,380 --> 00:52:09,380
実はね、二人を呼んだのはちょっと理由があって。
Actually, there's a reason why I invited the two of you.

632
00:52:09,480 --> 00:52:11,280
おー！なんだなんだ？
Oh! What is it, what is it?

633
00:52:11,380 --> 00:52:18,280
前に、アキロゼの4周年の時に、3人でカラフィナさんの曲を歌わせてもらったんだけど。
Before, during Akirose's 4th anniversary, the three of us sang a Kalafina song.

634
00:52:18,380 --> 00:52:22,680
やりようですね！めちゃくちゃ良かったよね。
Indeed we did! That was incredibly good.

635
00:52:22,780 --> 00:52:24,280
ハーモニーがね！ / そう！
The harmony was amazing! / Yes!

636
00:52:24,380 --> 00:52:32,180
もうね、ミオちゃんの歌も大好きだし、ロボ子さんの歌も大好きだし、ずっとね、忘れられないの、それが。
I love Mio-chan's singing, and I love Roboco-san's singing too, and I just couldn't forget that performance.

637
00:52:32,280 --> 00:52:35,280
わかる！わかる！めっちゃわかる！
I get it! I totally get it!

638
00:52:35,380 --> 00:52:41,280
そう！だからもう1回、このライブステージで3人歌いたくて、今日は来てもらいました！
Right! So, wanting us to sing together on this live stage again, I asked you to come today!

639
00:52:41,380 --> 00:52:44,380
嬉しい！ありがとう！
We're so happy! Thank you!

640
00:52:44,480 --> 00:52:46,280
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

641
00:52:46,780 --> 00:52:54,280
そう、だから、これからは、これを機に、もっと何か3人で歌いたりとか、そういうの挑戦できたらめっちゃ嬉しい！
So, starting from this, I'd be really happy if we could challenge ourselves to sing more as a trio!

642
00:52:54,380 --> 00:52:58,280
いいですね！ハーモニーを重ねていきましょうよ！
That sounds great! Let's layer our harmonies!

643
00:52:58,380 --> 00:53:01,680
えー！いいよ！嬉しい！
Yes! Absolutely! I'm so happy!

644
00:53:01,780 --> 00:53:03,280
ユニット名とか欲しいな。
I'd love for us to have a unit name.

645
00:53:03,380 --> 00:53:06,780
確かに！欲しい！えー、なんだろう？
True! We need one! What should it be?

646
00:53:06,880 --> 00:53:08,680
なんかちょっと、世界目指せるくらいのさ！
Something that can let us aim for the world!

647
00:53:08,780 --> 00:53:10,280
世界？！
The world?!

648
00:53:10,380 --> 00:53:13,180
世界の、世界のコンサートしようよ！
Let's hold a world, a world concert!

649
00:53:13,280 --> 00:53:15,280
したい！世界に届く何かをね！
I want to! Something that reaches the world!

650
00:53:15,380 --> 00:53:20,280
したいということで、3人でライブとか、アコースティックとか...
And so, since we want to do that, maybe a live show, acoustic...

651
00:53:20,380 --> 00:53:24,680
オーケストラライブとか！
Or an orchestral concert!

652
00:53:24,780 --> 00:53:29,280
わー！良くないですか、そんなこともしてみたい。
Wow! Wouldn't that be great? I want to try that too.

653
00:53:29,380 --> 00:53:31,380
我らならできるかもしれない！
With us, we might just be able to do it!

654
00:53:31,480 --> 00:53:33,780
おねがいします！
Please make it happen!

655
00:53:36,780 --> 00:53:39,680
あれ？これは一体何ですか？
Huh? What on earth is this?

656
00:53:39,780 --> 00:53:41,280
あ、も、もしかして...
Ah, c-could it be...

657
00:53:41,380 --> 00:53:46,680
このライブで、みんなからの、なんかいいパワーで...
With everyone's good power from this live show...

658
00:53:46,780 --> 00:53:50,280
なんかいいパワー？！なんかいいパワー来てる！儀式じゃんそれ！
Some good power?! Good power is coming! That's like a ritual!

659
00:53:50,380 --> 00:53:53,680
何なんだよ、そのパワー！
What is that power anyway?!

660
00:53:53,780 --> 00:53:56,780
こちらがなんと、完成しました！
This is, believe it or not, completed!

661
00:53:57,280 --> 00:54:00,280
何それ？！
What is that?!

662
00:54:00,380 --> 00:54:06,680
実は、このあと、アキロゼの新曲が出ます！
Actually, right after this, Akirose's new song will be out!

663
00:54:06,780 --> 00:54:11,280
わー！出た！やったー！
Wow! It's out! Yay!

664
00:54:11,380 --> 00:54:23,280
こちら、今回のライブのテーマというか、壮大なテーマがあるんですけど、そちらが詰まったような楽曲になっています。
This is like the theme of this live concert, featuring a grand theme packed into this song.

665
00:54:23,380 --> 00:54:30,180
そして、ライブ終わりの日付が変わる時にリリースしますので、ぜひ聴いてください！
And it will be released as the date changes right after the live, so please listen to it!

666
00:54:30,280 --> 00:54:34,280
聴いてねー！みんな聴こう！
Listen to it! Everyone, let's listen!

667
00:54:35,280 --> 00:54:37,180
ではでは、次の曲に行きますか？
Then, shall we move on to the next song?

668
00:54:37,280 --> 00:54:39,280
次の曲？
The next song?

669
00:54:39,380 --> 00:54:41,180
はい！新曲のお披露目...
Yes! The reveal of the new song...

670
00:54:41,280 --> 00:54:43,280
え、何だって？！
Wait, what?!

671
00:54:43,280 --> 00:54:46,280
しちゃいます！
...will happen now!

672
00:54:46,380 --> 00:54:47,680
え、今からってこと？！
Wait, you mean right now?!

673
00:54:47,780 --> 00:54:49,280
今から頑張ります！
Yes, I'll do my best right now!

674
00:54:49,380 --> 00:54:53,280
最後まで見逃せないですね！楽しみ！
We can't miss a single moment until the end! I'm excited!

675
00:54:53,380 --> 00:54:55,180
じゃあアキちゃん、頑張ってね！
Then, Aki-chan, do your best!

676
00:54:55,280 --> 00:54:58,280
ありがとう！頑張るよ！
Thank you! I will!

677
00:55:09,975 --> 00:55:11,875
魅惑の言葉の
Behind the alluring words,

678
00:55:11,875 --> 00:55:14,875
裏面に忍ばせた
hidden on the other side...

679
00:55:14,875 --> 00:55:17,975
1mgのスパイス
is just a milligram of spice.

680
00:55:17,975 --> 00:55:19,575
たちまち華麗に
Instantly and elegantly,

681
00:55:19,575 --> 00:55:23,175
指先で彩る
I color it with my fingertips.

682
00:55:23,175 --> 00:55:25,275
本日のダイス
Today's roll of the dice.

683
00:55:25,775 --> 00:55:28,975
辺り見て妥協してちゃ
If you look around and compromise,

684
00:55:28,975 --> 00:55:32,275
生き残れないでしょう
you won't survive, will you?

685
00:55:33,075 --> 00:55:34,775
率直に言って
To be completely frank,

686
00:55:34,775 --> 00:55:36,775
全てが欲しい
I want everything.

687
00:55:36,775 --> 00:55:40,275
一人勝ちにオールイン
Going all-in to win it all!

688
00:55:42,775 --> 00:55:44,775
どうなっちゃってもいいじゃない
What does it matter what happens to me?

689
00:55:44,775 --> 00:55:46,775
際限なんてないじゃない
There are absolutely no limits!

690
00:55:46,775 --> 00:55:48,875
翻弄して 翻弄されて
Toying with others, being toyed with,

691
00:55:48,875 --> 00:55:50,475
ゾク、ゾク
thrilled to the bone.

692
00:55:50,475 --> 00:55:52,575
喰らっちゃっても本望でしょ
Even if I'm consumed, it's what I want.

693
00:55:52,575 --> 00:55:54,575
最低だって滾るでしょ
Even if it's the worst, it gets the blood pumping!

694
00:55:54,575 --> 00:55:56,575
見透かして 見透かされて
Seeing right through, being seen right through,

695
00:55:56,575 --> 00:55:58,575
故に終わりは無い
so there will never be an end.

696
00:55:58,575 --> 00:56:01,975
高鳴るこの全て ノンフィクション
Everything that makes my heart race is non-fiction!

697
00:56:17,275 --> 00:56:19,575
嗜むはずでも
Though I only meant to enjoy a little,

698
00:56:19,575 --> 00:56:22,775
たまには飲みすぎて
sometimes I drink way too much.

699
00:56:22,775 --> 00:56:25,275
1回休み
Lose one turn.

700
00:56:25,775 --> 00:56:27,775
周りもザワつく
The crowd starts buzzing,

701
00:56:27,775 --> 00:56:30,575
思わぬうたた寝で
as I unexpectedly drift off to sleep.

702
00:56:30,575 --> 00:56:32,875
2回休み
Lose two turns.

703
00:56:33,975 --> 00:56:36,775
切れる頭と勘だけじゃ
Just sharp brains and intuition

704
00:56:36,775 --> 00:56:40,275
手に入らないモノ
won't get you what you want.

705
00:56:40,775 --> 00:56:44,475
速攻で射て 逃されるならいい
Shoot to kill instantly—if it gets away, so be it.

706
00:56:44,775 --> 00:56:48,275
命懸けで楽しむわ
I'm going to risk my life to have fun!

707
00:56:56,275 --> 00:56:58,575
天と地は案外近い
Heaven and earth are surprisingly close.

708
00:56:58,575 --> 00:57:00,375
この通り 命代わり
This is how it goes, my life is on the line.

709
00:57:00,375 --> 00:57:01,775
されど大往生
But what a glorious end it will be!

710
00:57:01,775 --> 00:57:04,575
秘める想い 此宵も 私は強い
With hidden feelings, tonight, I am strong!

711
00:57:07,775 --> 00:57:09,775
どうなっちゃってもいいじゃない
What does it matter what happens to me?

712
00:57:09,775 --> 00:57:11,775
際限なんてないじゃない
There are absolutely no limits!

713
00:57:11,775 --> 00:57:13,875
翻弄して 翻弄されて
Toying with others, being toyed with,

714
00:57:13,875 --> 00:57:15,475
ゾク、ゾク
thrilled to the bone.

715
00:57:15,475 --> 00:57:17,775
喰らっちゃっても本望でしょ
Even if I'm consumed, it's what I want.

716
00:57:17,775 --> 00:57:19,775
最低だって滾るでしょ
Even if it's the worst, it gets the blood pumping!

717
00:57:19,775 --> 00:57:21,775
見透かして 見透かされて
Seeing right through, being seen right through,

718
00:57:21,775 --> 00:57:23,775
故に終わりは無い
so there will never be an end.

719
00:57:23,775 --> 00:57:27,275
高鳴るこの全て ノンフィクション
Everything that makes my heart race is non-fiction!

720
00:57:27,775 --> 00:57:30,775
墜ちても 昇っても ノンフィクション
Whether falling or rising, it's all non-fiction!

721
00:58:03,775 --> 00:58:10,775
中川に浮かぶ 夕日をめがけて
Aiming for the sunset floating over Nakagawa River,

722
00:58:10,775 --> 00:58:17,775
小石を蹴ったら 靴まで飛んで
I kicked a pebble and my shoe went flying, too.

723
00:58:17,775 --> 00:58:25,775
ジョギングしていた 大工の頭領に
A carpenter boss who was jogging by

724
00:58:25,775 --> 00:58:32,275
ガキのまんまだと 笑われたのさ
laughed at me, saying I'm still just a kid.

725
00:58:32,775 --> 00:58:36,775
どこかに元気を 落っことしても
Even if I lose my high spirits somewhere,

726
00:58:36,775 --> 00:58:39,775
葛飾亀有 アクビをひとつ
here in Katsushika Kameari, I just let out a yawn.

727
00:58:39,775 --> 00:58:45,775
変わらない町並みが 妙にやさしいよ
This unchanging townscape is strangely comforting.

728
00:58:46,775 --> 00:58:54,775
中央広場で 子供の手を引く
Holding a child's hand at the central plaza,

729
00:58:54,775 --> 00:59:00,775
太ったあの娘は 初恋の彼女
that plump girl was my first love.

730
00:59:00,775 --> 00:59:07,775
ゴンパチ池で 渡したラブレター
The love letter I handed her at Gonpachi Pond,

731
00:59:07,775 --> 00:59:14,775
今も持ってると からかわれたよ
she teased me, saying she still has it.

732
00:59:14,775 --> 00:59:18,775
何にもいいこと なかったけど
Even though nothing particularly good happened,

733
00:59:18,775 --> 00:59:22,775
葛飾水元 流れる雲と
under the drifting clouds of Katsushika Mizumoto,

734
00:59:22,775 --> 00:59:29,275
ラプソディー口ずさみ 少し歩こうか
hum a rhapsody and let's walk a little.

735
00:59:31,275 --> 00:59:37,775
カラスが鳴くから もう日が暮れるね
The crows are crying, so the sun is setting.

736
00:59:37,775 --> 00:59:45,275
焼鳥ほうばり ビール飲もうか
Shall we stuff our faces with yakitori and have a beer?

737
00:59:45,775 --> 00:59:47,775
トンガリ帽子の
From the pointy-hat

738
00:59:47,775 --> 00:59:49,275
取水塔から
water intake tower,

739
00:59:49,275 --> 00:59:50,975
帝釈天へと
down towards Taishakuten,

740
00:59:50,975 --> 00:59:54,275
夕陽が落ちる
the evening sun sinks.

741
01:00:03,396 --> 01:00:06,496
明日もこうして 終わるんだね
Tomorrow will end just like this too,

742
01:00:06,496 --> 01:00:10,696
葛飾柴又 幸せだって
in Katsushika Shibamata, even when I said I was happy.

743
01:00:10,696 --> 01:00:16,596
なくして気がついた バカな女だから
I only realized after losing it, because I'm a foolish woman.

744
01:00:17,696 --> 01:00:21,596
どこかに元気を 落っことしても
Even if I lose my energy somewhere,

745
01:00:21,596 --> 01:00:25,196
葛飾亀有 アクビをひとつ
in Katsushika Kameari, I let out a yawn.

746
01:00:25,196 --> 01:00:31,496
変わらない町並みが 妙にやさしいよ
The unchanging townscape is strangely comforting.

747
01:00:54,496 --> 01:00:59,596
アキビ生誕祭2026をご覧の皆様、いかがでしたでしょうか？
Everyone watching Akibi Birthday Festival 2026, how did you enjoy it?

748
01:00:59,596 --> 01:01:06,396
さあ、ここからは大事なお知らせがあるから、最後までしっかり聞いていってね！
Now, I have some important announcements, so make sure to listen closely until the very end!

749
01:01:06,396 --> 01:01:08,796
まずは、お知らせ一つ目！
First up, the first announcement!

750
01:01:08,796 --> 01:01:13,896
アキロゼ生誕2026、誕生日グッズ発売です！
Akirose Birthday 2026 merchandise is now on sale!

751
01:01:13,896 --> 01:01:19,796
今回はライブの世界観をぎゅっと楽しんでもらえるグッズを頑張って制作いたしました。
This time, we worked hard to create merch that lets you fully enjoy the world of the concert.

752
01:01:19,796 --> 01:01:27,796
なので、今回のライブが良かったなーって思った方はぜひ応援で購入していただくのもすごく嬉しいです！
So, if you thought today's concert was great, I'd be so happy if you could show your support by buying them!

753
01:01:27,796 --> 01:01:32,796
それでは、まず一つ目のグッズ！Life is GAME ラバーマット！
Now for the first item! The "Life is GAME" rubber mat!

754
01:01:32,796 --> 01:01:38,396
今回のイラストはLAM先生に描き下ろしていただきました。素敵なイラストありがとうございます！
This illustration was specially drawn by LAM-sensei. Thank you for the wonderful illustration!

755
01:01:38,396 --> 01:01:42,796
今回のライブの世界観をイメージしたイラストになっています。
This illustration is inspired by the world of today's concert.

756
01:01:42,796 --> 01:01:48,196
めちゃくちゃセクシーで色っぽいけど、かっこいいようなアキロゼになっています。
It shows an Akirose who is super sexy and alluring, yet also cool.

757
01:01:48,196 --> 01:01:51,596
ラバーマットで思う存分楽しんでください。
Please enjoy it to your heart's content with this rubber mat.

758
01:01:51,596 --> 01:01:55,596
ちなみにサイズはカードゲームにぴったり！
By the way, the size is perfect for card games!

759
01:01:55,596 --> 01:01:58,596
この意味、わかるよね？
You know what that means, right?

760
01:01:58,596 --> 01:02:00,396
二つ目のグッズが、
The second item is...

761
01:02:00,396 --> 01:02:04,196
運命の5枚 タロット風アクリルスタンドセット！
the "5 Cards of Destiny: Tarot-style Acrylic Stand Set"!

762
01:02:04,196 --> 01:02:08,496
アキロゼがあなたのことを占って背中を押してあげます。
Akirose will read your fortune and give you a gentle push forward.

763
01:02:08,496 --> 01:02:13,896
一日の始まりや、何か運命を託したいみたいなそんな時に
At the start of your day, or when you want to leave things to fate,

764
01:02:13,896 --> 01:02:20,696
使って楽しむ、そして5枚バーンって飾っておけるので、見ても楽しめるようになっております。
you can play with them, or display all five prominently to enjoy them visually too.

765
01:02:20,696 --> 01:02:27,796
占い方法は、この後紹介するアキロゼのASMRボイスと連動しております。
The fortune-telling system links up with Akirose's ASMR voice pack, which I'll introduce next.

766
01:02:27,796 --> 01:02:34,196
飾っても楽しい、使っても楽しい、そのような連動グッズになっているので、ぜひゲットしてください！
They're fun to display and fun to use, so please grab yours!

767
01:02:34,196 --> 01:02:37,796
続いてのグッズは、アキロゼのトランプ！
The next item is "Akirose's Playing Cards"!

768
01:02:37,796 --> 01:02:40,796
作っちゃいました！
I actually made them!

769
01:02:40,796 --> 01:02:44,396
こちら、実際に遊んでいただけるトランプなので、
Since you can actually play games with these cards,

770
01:02:44,396 --> 01:02:49,296
たくさん、予備も買った方がいいんじゃないかなーと思います！
I think it might be a good idea to buy multiple decks, even a spare one!

771
01:02:49,296 --> 01:02:54,196
ぜひトランプでもアキロゼをたくさん楽しんで、アピールもしてくださいね。
Please enjoy seeing Akirose on these cards and show them off to everyone.

772
01:02:54,196 --> 01:02:55,796
続いては、こちら！
Next up is this!

773
01:02:55,796 --> 01:02:58,396
アキロゼのカードケース！
The "Akirose Card Case"!

774
01:02:58,396 --> 01:03:01,896
これはもちろん、トランプなど小物入れても大丈夫です。
Of course, you can also use this to store playing cards or other small items.

775
01:03:01,896 --> 01:03:05,496
ぜひおうちや、持ち歩きに使ってね。
Please use it at home or carry it around with you.

776
01:03:05,496 --> 01:03:07,596
そして、ボイスの紹介です。
And now, let me introduce the voice packs.

777
01:03:07,596 --> 01:03:12,196
今回もASMRボイスを特別に発売！
We are specially releasing ASMR voice packs this time too!

778
01:03:12,196 --> 01:03:18,596
アキとロゼがそれぞれ左右からあなたのことを誘惑しちゃうかも。
Aki and Rose might whisper from both sides to tempt you.

779
01:03:18,596 --> 01:03:23,696
台本も頑張って書いたので、ぜひぜひたっぷり楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいです。
I worked hard writing the script myself, so I really hope you enjoy it fully.

780
01:03:23,696 --> 01:03:28,896
こちらボイスは「Life is GAME〜アキロゼの盤上〜」こちらをメインとし、
The main voice track is "Life is GAME: On Akirose's Board",

781
01:03:28,896 --> 01:03:34,796
ASMRショートボイスとして、先ほどの「運命の5枚 タロット風アクリルカード」と連動したショートボイスが入っております。
and there are also ASMR short voices linked to the "5 Cards of Destiny: Tarot-style Acrylic Cards" mentioned earlier.

782
01:03:34,796 --> 01:03:44,896
ショートボイスのシャッフル・ランダム再生をして選ばれたボイスが、あなたの運命の1枚になります。ぜひ色々楽しんでね！
By shuffling and randomly playing these short voices, the voice you pull will be your card of destiny. Please have fun with it!

783
01:03:44,896 --> 01:03:48,096
これらのグッズ全てが詰まったフルセット購入には、なんと特典もついております。
Purchasing the full set containing all of these items also comes with a special bonus!

784
01:03:48,096 --> 01:03:53,396
今回のキービジュアルのイラストを使ったチケット風カードになっております。
It's a ticket-style card featuring this concert's key visual illustration.

785
01:03:53,396 --> 01:03:57,696
「あなたは、このゲームに参加する？」参加したい？
"Will you join this game?" Do you want to join?

786
01:03:57,696 --> 01:04:06,596
こちらもライブの世界観を高めるアイテムになっているので、ぜひゲットしてください。
This is also an item designed to immerse you further into the concert's world, so please get it.

787
01:04:06,596 --> 01:04:09,396
そして、数量限定あります。
Also, there is a limited-quantity version.

788
01:04:09,396 --> 01:04:16,596
直筆サインと箔押し複製メッセージが入ったものになっております。頑張って書きます！
It features a handwritten signature and a foil-stamped printed message. I'll do my best to write them!

789
01:04:16,596 --> 01:04:23,196
そして、数量限定が終わり次第、箔押しでの複製サインとメッセージが入ったチケット風カードになります。
Once the limited-quantity version is sold out, it will be a ticket-style card with a foil-stamped printed signature and message.

790
01:04:23,196 --> 01:04:26,596
ぜひフルセット購入特典ゲットしてね。
Please make sure to get the full set purchase bonus.

791
01:04:26,596 --> 01:04:33,596
大切な発売時間は、この後21時30分！21時30分にショップオープンです！
The important release time is tonight at 21:30! The shop opens at 21:30!

792
01:04:33,596 --> 01:04:38,396
ぜひ登録など準備して備えておいてね。
Please get ready by signing up beforehand so you're prepared.

793
01:04:38,396 --> 01:04:40,796
続きまして、お知らせ二つ目！
Moving on to the second announcement!

794
01:04:40,796 --> 01:04:48,196
この後、21時45分からメンバー限定のアフターライブを行います！
After this, starting from 21:45, we will hold a members-only after-show concert!

795
01:04:48,196 --> 01:04:54,196
ライブ本編とまた違う楽曲を披露する予定なので、ぜひお楽しみに！
I plan to perform different songs from the main concert, so please look forward to it!

796
01:04:54,196 --> 01:04:57,396
今日メンバーになった方もぜひぜひ見てね。
Those who became members today, please be sure to watch it too.

797
01:04:57,396 --> 01:05:01,396
ちなみに、過去のライブのメンバー限定、
By the way, the members-only archives of past concerts...

798
01:05:02,121 --> 01:05:04,221
アライブもね、見れちゃうと思うので、
I think you can watch the archive as well, so...

799
01:05:04,221 --> 01:05:07,021
ぜひその辺りも見てみてね！
please be sure to check that out too!

800
01:05:07,221 --> 01:05:10,621
ちなみに今回のサムネイルイラストは、
By the way, the thumbnail illustration for this event...

801
01:05:10,621 --> 01:05:14,421
メンバー限定で壁紙としてプレゼント予定です！
will be given to members as a wallpaper!

802
01:05:14,421 --> 01:05:16,421
お楽しみに！
Look forward to it!

803
01:05:16,621 --> 01:05:19,521
そして、お知らせ3つ目！
And now, the third announcement!

804
01:05:19,521 --> 01:05:23,021
本日の生誕祭ライブの後も...
Even after today's Birthday Live...

805
01:05:23,021 --> 01:05:26,821
お楽しみはまだまだ続きます！
the fun is far from over!

806
01:05:26,821 --> 01:05:29,521
なんと！ホロアースにて特別企画、
We actually have a special event in Holoearth!

807
01:05:29,521 --> 01:05:34,521
アキ・ローゼンタール 生誕祭2020 アンコール...
Aki Rosenthal Birthday Live 2020 Encore...

808
01:05:34,521 --> 01:05:38,521
in ホロアースを開催します！
will be held in Holoearth!

809
01:05:38,521 --> 01:05:44,621
今回、初披露した新曲『モノポリー』をホロアースで歌います！
I will sing my newly debuted song, "Monopoly", in Holoearth!

810
01:05:44,621 --> 01:05:52,121
いろんな角度からアキロゼのパフォーマンスや演出をじっくりと見てみてくださいね！
Please take a close look at AkiRose's performance and stage effects from various angles!

811
01:05:52,121 --> 01:05:59,221
さらに、ホロアースだけのMCパートもたっぷりあるので、ぜひぜひ会いに来てください！
Plus, there will be plenty of Holoearth-exclusive MC parts, so please come see me!

812
01:05:59,221 --> 01:06:04,221
開催日は3月13日、3月13日です！
The event date is March 13th! March 13th!

813
01:06:04,221 --> 01:06:08,221
詳細はホロアース公式Xをチェックしてね！
Check the official Holoearth X account for details!

814
01:06:08,221 --> 01:06:11,221
そして、最後のお知らせが...
And now, for the final announcement...

815
01:06:11,221 --> 01:06:13,921
新曲『モノポリー』！
My new song, "Monopoly"!

816
01:06:13,921 --> 01:06:17,221
本日、日付が変わる頃にリリースされますので、
It will be released today when the clock strikes midnight,...

817
01:06:17,221 --> 01:06:21,321
各音楽配信サービスからぜひ購入してね！
so please buy it from any music streaming service!

818
01:06:21,321 --> 01:06:23,921
たくさん聴いてね！
Listen to it a lot, okay?!

819
01:06:23,921 --> 01:06:29,621
振り付けも、歌もとってもキャッチーなので、覚えてみんなで楽しんでもらえる...
The choreography and song are super catchy, so I hope everyone memorizes it...

820
01:06:29,621 --> 01:06:34,521
愛されるような楽曲になってくれたら嬉しいなって思っています！
and enjoys it as a beloved song. That would make me so happy!

821
01:06:34,521 --> 01:06:41,221
また、後日ライブ配信で新曲『モノポリー』だったり、今回のライブに触れた後日談など語ったり...
Also, I'll be doing a live stream later to talk about the new song "Monopoly" and behind-the-scenes stories of this live show...

822
01:06:41,221 --> 01:06:45,121
一緒に見たりなどしたいなと思っているので、ぜひ！
and watch it together with you, so please...

823
01:06:45,121 --> 01:06:49,421
チャンネル登録、高評価ぽち、通知もオン！
subscribe to my channel, hit the like button, and turn on notifications!

824
01:06:49,421 --> 01:06:52,121
するの忘れてた人は今ぽちっとしてね！
If you forgot, please click them right now!

825
01:06:52,121 --> 01:06:54,921
絶対絶対また会いに来てね！
Be sure to come see me again!

826
01:06:54,921 --> 01:06:56,921
それでは...
And now...

827
01:06:56,921 --> 01:06:59,721
運命は時に残酷。
Destiny is cruel at times.

828
01:06:59,721 --> 01:07:03,421
あなたが選びたくて選んだものではないかもしれない。
It may not be what you wanted to choose.

829
01:07:03,421 --> 01:07:08,721
だけど、いつでもあなたの人生はあなたのもの。
But your life is always your own.

830
01:07:08,721 --> 01:07:11,221
人生は一度きり。
You only live once.

831
01:07:11,221 --> 01:07:14,221
やり直しのきかないこのゲーム、
In this game where there are no do-overs,

832
01:07:14,221 --> 01:07:17,621
あなたはどう楽しむ？
how will you enjoy it?

833
01:11:06,107 --> 01:11:15,407
START
END

